### Analysis API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@prId = YOUR_PR_ID_HERE
@analysisId = YOUR_ANALYSIS_RESULT_ID_HERE

###############################################
### Manual PR Analysis Endpoint (POST /analysis/manual)
###############################################

### 1. Run ALL modules (default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pullRequestId": "{{prId}}",
  "provider": "openai",
  "githubToken": "ghp_yourtoken",
  "includeDiff": true
}

###

### 2. Run specific modules only
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pullRequestId": "{{prId}}",
  "provider": "claude",
  "includeDiff": false,
  "modules": ["bug", "security"]
}

###

### 3. Validation - missing pullRequestId (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "provider": "openai"
}

###

### 4. Validation - invalid provider (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pullRequestId": "{{prId}}",
  "provider": "invalidprovider"
}

###

### 5. Validation - invalid module name (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pullRequestId": "{{prId}}",
  "modules": ["bug", "nonexistent"]
}

###

### 6. No token (Should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pullRequestId": "{{prId}}"
}

###

###############################################
### Results & Status
###############################################

### 7. Get all analysis results for a PR
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/results/{{prId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Get analysis status by result ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/status/{{analysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Status - not found (Should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/status/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### Unified Full Analysis
###############################################

### 10. Run unified analysis via path param
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/full/{{prId}}?provider=openai&includeDiff=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### Individual Module Endpoints
###############################################

### 11. Bug detection
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/bugs/{{prId}}?provider=openai&includeDiff=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Security analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/security/{{prId}}?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. Performance analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/performance/{{prId}}?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 14. Code quality analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/code-quality/{{prId}}?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Test case coverage
POST {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test-cases/{{prId}}?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### Provider Connectivity Tests
###############################################

### 16. Test OpenAI connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 17. Test Claude connectivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/claude
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 18. Test provider switching
GET {{baseUrl}}/analysis/test/provider?provider=openai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
